#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:1
#: 8cf2dd43d29d4cac87f3765d52398ac5
msgid "卡片文档编写规范"
msgstr "Writing Card Documentation"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:3
#: 112b3b263f9f43c4b70cbbdab3b948de
msgid ""
"目标：让用户从\"模型哪里不行 → 训练集缺什么数据 → 选哪张卡 → 设什么参数 → 怎"
"么判断改善\"一路走通，而不是只解释每个参数的抽象含义。"
msgstr ""
"Goal: guide users from “where the model fails → what data the training set "
"lacks → which card to choose → which parameters to set → how to verify "
"improvement,” rather than merely defining parameters in isolation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:5
#: 9e597d7fb26743b7befbb97893d7d7b7
msgid "语言风格"
msgstr "Writing style"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:7
#: e9d5485e636e433296c5b1ee10f9410e
msgid "核心原则：像人在给你讲，不像在查 schema"
msgstr ""
"Core principle: explain like a knowledgeable colleague, not a schema browser"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:9
#: 6a0268055e344e4f9ac101d0b0f7fbc2
msgid ""
"参数说明是写给用户的，不是写给数据库的。如果 33 张卡、每张卡 5-20 个参数，全"
"用同一个句式写，用户读 3 张就疲劳了。"
msgstr ""
"Parameter descriptions are for users, not databases. Repeating one sentence "
"pattern across dozens of cards and hundreds of parameters makes the manual "
"exhausting to read."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:11
#: 9de3bb05bad342938622000dceba863b
msgid "禁止的写法"
msgstr "Avoid"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:13
#: ea046da9acd5485bbcfd1813011e1a8b
msgid ""
"每段以独立一行的 \"类型：X。默认：Y。\" 开头，然后再换行另起一段\"解释\"。类"
"型和默认值是背景信息，不是段落主角。"
msgstr ""
"Opening every block with a standalone “Type: X. Default: Y.” line and moving "
"the actual explanation to another paragraph. Type and default are context, "
"not the main point."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:14
#: 4bc9eff26c2348c29b255f0350cf7f34
msgid "所有参数用同一个句式：\"设置 XXX。\"\"决定是否 XXX。\"\"选择 XXX。\""
msgstr ""
"Using the same template for every parameter: “Sets X,” “Determines whether "
"X,” or “Selects X.”"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:15
#: 572c8f0b0973469d9d2f382505b5f87a
msgid ""
"第一行和第二行语义重复——先说\"设置位移距离\"，再换行说\"每个原子的位移\"。"
msgstr ""
"Repeating the same idea in consecutive sentences, such as “sets the "
"displacement distance” followed by “the displacement of each atom.”"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:16
#: 169f373a12554671a1e0edac1871f591
msgid "通篇没有\"你\"——读者感觉是在看机器生成的规格书，不是有人在跟自己说话。"
msgstr ""
"Never addressing the reader, which makes the page feel like a generated "
"specification instead of practical guidance."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:18
#: d38e8c118abf446690f7ba2b2c9581ca
msgid "推荐写法"
msgstr "Preferred approach"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:20
#: badb471942a643ea8b974db66d857565
msgid ""
"类型和默认值压缩成一句话，然后直接进入读者真正关心的内容。句式要有变化，要敢"
"用\"你\"。"
msgstr ""
"Compress type and default into one sentence, then move directly to what the "
"reader needs to decide. Vary sentence structure and address the reader "
"naturally when giving advice."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:22
#: 77a7b1914b4545ebbe7216d57eebd998
msgid "**改前（机器感）：**"
msgstr "**Before (schema-like):**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:24
#: 36358a85f5af4cf5a2cf57ffc8c2724a
msgid ""
"### Max Distance（max_distance）\n"
"类型：`float`。默认：`0.3`。设置原子随机位移的最大距离。\n"
"\n"
"每个原子的最大位移向量长度。这是绝对长度（单位 Å），不是每个 Cartesian 分量的"
"上限，也不是百分比。室温下典型固体原子振动幅度约 0.05~0.1 Å，设 0.15~0.3 Å 通"
"常合适。含 H 等轻元素时考虑开启 `use_element_scaling` 单独调大 H 的幅度。\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Max Distance (`max_distance`)\n"
"Type: `float`. Default: `0.3`. Sets the maximum random atomic displacement.\n"
"\n"
"The maximum length of each atom's displacement vector. This is an absolute "
"length in Å, not a per-component bound or a percentage. Typical room-"
"temperature vibrational amplitudes are around 0.05–0.1 Å, so 0.15–0.3 Å is "
"often suitable. For light elements such as H, consider "
"`use_element_scaling`.\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:31
#: a01fbd838eff46c59604bbbedb95dd21
msgid "**改后：**"
msgstr "**After:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:33
#: 53817fcb912f41e48cd12830484a0563
msgid ""
"### Max Distance（max_distance）\n"
"\n"
"`float`，默认 0.3。每个原子的最大位移，单位 Å。\n"
"\n"
"这个值不是 Cartesian 分量上限，也不是应变百分比——就是一个原子最多被挪多远。室"
"温下原子振动幅度约 0.05~0.1 Å，设 0.15~0.3 Å 通常够用。如果体系含 H 等轻元"
"素，H 的振幅天然更大，建议同时开启 `use_element_scaling` 单独给 H 调大。设到 "
"0.3~0.5 Å 以上时，跑完务必抽查最近邻键长——这个量级已经可能拉断键了。\n"
"\n"
"生效条件：开启 `use_element_scaling` 后，对在 `element_scalings` 中列出的元"
"素，这个值会被覆盖。\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Max Distance (`max_distance`)\n"
"\n"
"`float`, default: `0.3`. Maximum displacement of each atom, in Å.\n"
"\n"
"This is neither a Cartesian-component bound nor a strain percentage; it is "
"the farthest an atom may move. Room-temperature vibrational amplitudes are "
"often around 0.05–0.1 Å, so 0.15–0.3 Å is usually sufficient. If the system "
"contains light elements such as H, enable `use_element_scaling` and give H a "
"larger limit. At 0.3–0.5 Å or above, inspect nearest-neighbor distances "
"after generation because bonds may be severely distorted.\n"
"\n"
"Effective when: with `use_element_scaling` enabled, values listed in "
"`element_scalings` override this global limit.\n"

