msgid "随机性、可复现条件"
msgstr "What is random, and under which conditions is it reproducible?"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:0
#: f183d0fee872456189d988956eb54a81
msgid "`## 可复现性`"
msgstr "`## Reproducibility`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:86
#: 2893368eee454514b2d0a10d79f29865
msgid ""
"`适用场景与不适用场景` 和 `输入前提` 不再要求独立章节——合并到操作示例（\"什么"
"时候加这张卡\"）和参数说明中。"
msgstr ""
"Separate “when to use / when not to use” and “input prerequisites” sections "
"are optional. Integrate that information into the worked example and "
"parameter guidance instead."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:88
#: a97aab81f91749dbaf55ea0afc24f8e3
msgid "操作示例模板（最重要）"
msgstr "Worked-example template (highest priority)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:90
#: 2126f00f49ab42aab222fe866f4eeb5c
msgid "操作示例必须从**训练集诊断**出发，不能只写\"设参数→得结果\"。结构："
msgstr ""
"A worked example must begin with a **training-set diagnosis**, not merely "
"“set parameters → get output.” Use this structure:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:92
#: a0406fe5b4f646939cfaf56acd5d3b92
msgid ""
"### 场景：模型在 [具体任务] 上 [具体失败表现]\n"
"\n"
"[一句话诊断根因：训练集缺什么数据]\n"
"\n"
"**输入：** [具体结构]\n"
"**目标：** [加入什么数据，预期解决什么问题]\n"
"**参数设置：** [具体参数值]\n"
"**输出：** [预期输出描述]\n"
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** [重训后应看到什么变化；不够的话下一步怎么调]\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Scenario: the model [specific failure] on [specific task]\n"
"\n"
"[Diagnose in one sentence what data the training set lacks.]\n"
"\n"
"**Input:** [concrete structure]\n"
"**Goal:** [data to add and problem it should address]\n"
"**Parameters:** [specific values]\n"
"**Output:** [expected structures]\n"
"**How to verify improvement:** [change expected after labeling and "
"retraining; next adjustment if insufficient]\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:104
#: fca8d0c796bc4752b0ed2ccce79d9419
msgid "示例（Lattice Strain）："
msgstr "Example: Lattice Strain"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:106
#: 3257f7152e2a45a29603a843eceb62af
msgid ""
"### 场景：模型预测的弹性常数偏差太大\n"
"\n"
"NEP 模型 C11 比 DFT 参考值高 15%。训练集所有结构都处在平衡体积附近，模型没见"
"过被拉伸/压缩的晶胞，只能外推。\n"
"\n"
"**输入：** 弛豫好的 Si 单胞\n"
"**目标：** 加入 ±2% 单轴应变结构，让模型在弹性区内有内插依据\n"
"**参数设置：** Axes=uniaxial, x_range=[-2, 2, 1]\n"
"**输出：** 5 个结构（-2%, -1%, 0%, +1%, +2%）\n"
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后 C11 应接近 DFT 参考值；不够则扩到 ±5%\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Scenario: the predicted elastic constant is too inaccurate\n"
"\n"
"The NEP value of C11 is 15% above the DFT reference. Every training "
"structure lies near the equilibrium volume, so strained cells are "
"extrapolations.\n"
"\n"
"**Input:** A relaxed Si unit cell\n"
"**Goal:** Add ±2% uniaxial strain states so the elastic region is "
"interpolative\n"
"**Parameters:** `Axes=uniaxial`, `x_range=[-2, 2, 1]`\n"
"**Output:** Five structures at −2%, −1%, 0%, +1%, and +2%\n"
"**How to verify improvement:** After DFT labeling and retraining, C11 should "
"approach the reference; if needed, extend the range to ±5%\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:118
#: 339b7d7edb254b93810073aea3647c1d
msgid "示例（Magnetic Order）："
msgstr "Example: Magnetic Order"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:120
#: 25e7adf4036d4f75ac7dc8fde306c1d4
msgid ""
"### 场景：FM 模型在 AFM 相上预测崩了\n"
"\n"
"bcc Fe 的 NEP 模型，FM 构型推理准确但 AFM 构型能量误差是 FM 的 5 倍。训练集只"
"有一种磁序。\n"
"\n"
"**输入：** bcc Fe 晶体，已知 Fe 磁矩约 2.2 μB\n"
"**目标：** 生成 1 FM + 1 AFM + 8 PM，让模型见过不同磁序的局域磁环境\n"
"**参数设置：** magmom_map=Fe:2.2, gen_fm+gen_afm+gen_pm, pm_count=8\n"
"**输出：** 10 个不同磁序结构\n"
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后 FM/AFM 推理能量误差差距应显著缩小\n"
msgstr "\\### Scenario: an FM model fails on the AFM phase\n"
"\n"
"A bcc Fe NEP predicts FM configurations accurately, but the AFM energy error is five times larger. The training set contains only one magnetic order.\n"
"\n"
"**Input:** bcc Fe with a known Fe moment of about 2.2 μB\n"
"**Goal:** generate 1 FM + 1 AFM + 8 PM structures so the model sees local environments from different magnetic orders\n"
"**Parameters:** magmom_map=Fe:2.2, gen_fm+gen_afm+gen_pm, pm_count=8\n"
"**Output:** 10 structures with different magnetic orders\n"
"**How to verify improvement:** after retraining, the FM/AFM inference energy-error gap should shrink substantially\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:132
#: 540bb5a2c7034898b07fc3cb5afca444
msgid "示例（Random Doping）："
msgstr "Example: Random Doping"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:134
#: 89aa046254064b139073b495bce66a49
msgid ""
"### 场景：纯元素模型在掺杂体系上完全失效\n"
"\n"
"纯 Si 训练的 NEP 模型碰到 Si:Ge 合金，力误差跳了一个数量级。模型从来没见过 "
"Ge 原子。\n"
"\n"
"**输入：** 纯 Si 超胞\n"
"**目标：** 替换 3-8% 的 Si 为 Ge，每帧生成 20 个掺杂版本\n"
"**参数设置：** "
"rules(target=Si,dopants=Ge:1.0,use=atomic_percent,percent=[3,8]), "
"doping_type=Exact, max_structures=20\n"
"**输出：** 20 个掺杂结构\n"
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后 Si:Ge 测试集力 MAE 应回到纯 Si 水平\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Scenario: an elemental model fails on a doped system\n"
"\n"
"An NEP model trained on pure Si shows an order-of-magnitude force-error "
"increase on Si–Ge because it has never seen Ge environments.\n"
"\n"
"**Input:** A pure-Si supercell\n"
"**Goal:** Replace 3–8% of Si with Ge and generate 20 doped variants per "
"frame\n"
"**Parameters:** "
"`rules(target=Si,dopants=Ge:1.0,use=atomic_percent,percent=[3,8])`, "
"`doping_type=Exact`, `max_structures=20`\n"
"**Output:** Twenty doped structures\n"
"**How to verify improvement:** After labeling and retraining, force MAE on a "
"held-out Si–Ge test set should approach the pure-Si error\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:146
#: c6a3ce4e21e3420ea66415924d18de15
msgid "参数说明写法"
msgstr "Writing parameter sections"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:148
#: 63940fe00b0444b18e1b1ca4e0b10d75
msgid ""
"只允许一种参数写法：每个 `Params dataclass` 字段必须有独立标题，标题里的 key "
"必须和代码字段完全一致。"
msgstr ""
"Use one consistent structure: every field in the `Params` dataclass has its "
"own heading, and the key in that heading must exactly match the code."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:150
#: 8a063f0eeae54099960ad5c1e54deebb
msgid "参数少、没有明显功能组时，直接使用三级标题："
msgstr ""
"For a short parameter list with no natural groups, use level-three headings:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:152
#: 521b5d2298d94ed18a8100658964ea82
msgid ""
"### Axes（axes）\n"
"\n"
"类型：`str`。默认：`\"uniaxial\"`。决定对哪些晶格轴施加应变。\n"
"\n"
"物理直觉：单轴用于补 C11/C22/C33；双轴用于泊松耦合；各向同性用于 EOS 或体模量"
"附近采样。\n"
"\n"
"| 选项 | 含义 | 什么时候选 |\n"
"|------|------|-----------|\n"
"| `uniaxial` | 一次只拉压一个轴 | 弹性常数、各向异性响应 |\n"
"| `biaxial` | 两两组合 | 面内耦合、薄膜应变 |\n"
"| `isotropic` | 三轴等比例 | 体积-能量曲线 |\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Axes (`axes`)\n"
"\n"
"`str`, default: `\"uniaxial\"`. Selects which lattice axes are strained "
"together.\n"
"\n"
"Physical interpretation: use uniaxial strain for C11/C22/C33-like responses, "
"biaxial strain for coupled in-plane or Poisson response, and isotropic "
"strain for an equation of state or bulk modulus.\n"
"\n"
"| Option | Meaning | When to use |\n"
"|--------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| `uniaxial` | Strain one axis at a time | Elastic constants and anisotropic "
"response |\n"
"| `biaxial` | Strain axis pairs | In-plane coupling and film strain |\n"
"| `isotropic` | Scale all three axes equally | Energy–volume curves |\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:166
#: cbb952715c7045f79374fe4de1826038
msgid "参数多且存在天然功能组时，用三级标题表示功能组，用四级标题表示参数："
msgstr ""
"For many parameters with natural functional groups, use level-three headings "
"for groups and level-four headings for fields:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:168
#: 81dce311bdf447038041dfa3fff7ac54
msgid ""
"### 磁矩幅值来源\n"
"\n"
"#### Magmom Map（magmom_map）\n"
"\n"
"类型：`str`。默认：`\"\"`。按元素指定磁矩幅值，例如 `Fe:2.2, Ni:0.6`。\n"
"\n"
"物理直觉：已知元素局域磁矩时优先用它，避免不同磁性卡各自写一套不一致的幅"
"值。\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Moment-magnitude source\n"
"\n"
"\\#### Magmom Map (`magmom_map`)\n"
"\n"
"`str`, default: `\"\"`. Assign element-specific magnitudes, for example "
"`Fe:2.2, Ni:0.6`.\n"
"\n"
"Physical interpretation: when trusted local moments are known, define them "
"once here so downstream magnetic cards do not drift into inconsistent "
"magnitudes.\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:178
#: 1f4ff9e5b4a4412a825822c2e71e0bdd
msgid "每个参数 block 固定包含："
msgstr "Every parameter block contains:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:180
#: e5bdd61b7f514c42aca3c1285459f5e1
msgid "第一段：类型、默认值、这个参数实际控制什么。"
msgstr ""
"First paragraph: type, default, and the quantity or behavior actually "
"controlled."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:181
#: aaac682f180d4b7b9aa5fe08a99b37ba
msgid "第二段：物理直觉或数据集使用场景，必须给量级或判断依据。"
msgstr ""
"Second paragraph: physical intuition or a dataset scenario, including a "
"useful scale or decision criterion."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:182
#: de0b75ce7336408ea0943038adf2e49a
msgid "枚举参数：加表格，列出选项、含义、什么时候选。"
msgstr ""
"Enums: a table listing each real option, its meaning, and when to choose it."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:183
#: 40b61c314cc34d80a03e18613624774b
msgid ""
"条件参数：单独写 `生效条件：...`，不要让用户猜这个参数什么时候会被忽略。"
msgstr ""
"Conditional fields: an explicit `Effective when: ...` line so users know "
"when the field is ignored."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:185
#: deb604fbef4d4f7790bca33ce66e715e
msgid ""
"禁止把多个 key 合在一个标题里，例如 `Use Seed / Seed（use_seed / seed）`。必"
"须拆成 `### Use Seed（use_seed）` 和 `### Seed（seed）`。 禁止用占位表格，例"
"如 `以 UI 下拉项为准`。枚举表必须写出真实选项，如 Sobol/Uniform、Collinear/"
"Non-collinear、sphere/cone。 禁止用可套在任何参数上的模板句。`物理直觉` 必须"
"能回答这个参数调大、调小、切换选项时具体改变了什么物理状态或数据分布。"
msgstr ""
"Do not combine several keys under one heading such as `Use Seed / Seed "
"(use_seed / seed)`; split them into `### Use Seed (use_seed)` and `### Seed "
"(seed)`. Do not use placeholder enum tables such as “see the UI dropdown.” "
"List real options—Sobol/Uniform, Collinear/Non-collinear, sphere/cone. Avoid "
"generic text that fits any field. The physical explanation must state how "
"increasing, decreasing, or switching the parameter changes the physical "
"state or data distribution."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:189
#: b23852c488924087a07ba05606711700
msgid "**禁止在参数说明中出现的内容：**"
msgstr "**Do not include the following in user-facing parameter sections:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:190
#: ea083348a96f43ffa4ce59ce6a1fa527
msgid "`UI Label`、`字段映射`、`控件标签`、`控件解释` 等 UI 实现细节"
msgstr ""
"UI implementation details such as `UI Label`, field mappings, widget labels, "
"or widget explanations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:191
#: 18b40878b79f4054b1a83c4c33962a39
msgid "序列化格式说明（如\"这是序列化结构字段，不是用户开关\"）"
msgstr ""
"Serialization-internal explanations such as “this is a serialized structure "
"field, not a user option”"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:192
#: 791cc2c0fc67482cb09d69f708006fa3
msgid "`params` 作为独立参数块列出——这是内部实现，用户不需要知道"
msgstr "A separate `params` parameter block; it is an implementation detail"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:193
#: 4f4039bdda9e4371b0ee2b0947a196e8
msgid ""
"\"先用默认值跑小样本；只有当你能明确说明它会改变当前结果分布时再主动偏离\" 等"
"模板填充句"
msgstr ""
"Filler advice such as “start with the default and change it only when you "
"know it affects the distribution”"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:195
#: 2867aaf5a89b4c74966526e23355b362
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:197
#: c2413470e4cc4668a3a166ed817a377d
msgid "至少覆盖以下 3 类真问题（不要泛化模板句）："
msgstr ""
"Cover at least these three concrete problem types without generic filler:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:199
#: 311639a620254bd5b07a61e087201487
msgid "输出为空时**这张卡最常见的原因**"
msgstr "The card-specific reason output is empty"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:200
#: ac29c0c5b4e3491fba4f761915520048
msgid "输出不合理时**具体怎么判断和回调**"
msgstr ""
"The concrete diagnostic and parameter adjustment for unreasonable output"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:201
#: f911e96fc8b94b8cbe964ab823c4fa87
msgid "参数冲突或越界时**程序的实际行为**"
msgstr ""
"The program's actual behavior when parameters conflict or exceed bounds"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:203
#: 57d7d1c3c9da4497ab6fbb7679b28995
msgid "描述行为只能写代码的真实逻辑，不要臆造不存在的自动修复。"
msgstr ""
"Describe only behavior implemented in code; do not invent automatic recovery."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:205
#: 66651952e3064b5687c97ba9df9f4081
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:207
#: 1c184069030f4ba9ace7aafa8e574082
msgid ""
"必须写具体的卡片名，例如 `Lattice Strain → Atomic Perturb`，不要写\"当前卡片 "
"→ 目标变换卡\"。"
msgstr ""
"Name concrete cards, for example `Lattice Strain → Atomic Perturb`, instead "
"of placeholders such as “current card → target transformation.”"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:208
#: c9588ae3a51e4ca2825d1fffeef16c30
msgid "至少 2 条不同目的的组合建议。"
msgstr "Provide at least two combinations that serve distinct purposes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:210
#: cf01fa025383445895e1e4ff6db15de4
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:212
#: 999540c19b2b487b907d392af83ab91e
msgid "每档必须有实质性参数差异，不要三档 JSON 几乎一样。"
msgstr ""
"Presets must differ materially; do not provide three nearly identical JSON "
"blocks."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:213
#: b060819c3d9a46e28d0720b816e7409c
msgid ""
"每个 JSON 附带一行说明，解释\"这个预设解决什么问题，什么情况下选这一档\"。"
msgstr ""
"Add one sentence to every JSON preset explaining the problem it solves and "
"when to choose it."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:214
#: 92b1c0902855410abd3243ea8388590a
msgid "如果卡片参数少、不需要三档，允许只保留 1-2 个预设。"
msgstr ""
"For a simple card, one or two meaningful presets are better than three "
"artificial tiers."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:216
#: 8b9540cd3a3d4bc2aaa70dc0f5b11bab
msgid "禁止内容"
msgstr "Prohibited content"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:218
#: 626e104438c4484d944b3b853c118f3d
msgid "\"先保守再放大\" 类空泛建议。"
msgstr "Vague advice such as “start conservative, then scale up.”"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:219
#: 880ceb449bab4fafb9d4be6cb2a86542
msgid "\"先用默认值跑小样本\" 类模板填充句。"
msgstr "Template filler such as “run a small sample with defaults first.”"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:220
#: 424b8b2b4a624e6693b414d7d480dd83
msgid "与卡片无关的统一 Physics caution 模板句。"
msgstr ""
"A generic physics-caution paragraph unrelated to the card's actual behavior."

