#~ msgid ""
#~ "### 场景：FM 模型在 AFM 相上预测崩了\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "bcc Fe 的 NEP 模型，FM 构型推理准确但 AFM 构型能量误差是 FM 的 5 倍。训练"
#~ "集只有一种磁序。\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "**输入：** bcc Fe 晶体，已知 Fe 磁矩约 2.2 μB\n"
#~ "**目标：** 生成 1 FM + 1 AFM + 8 PM，让模型见过不同磁序的局域磁环境\n"
#~ "**参数设置：** magmom_map=Fe:2.2, gen_fm+gen_afm+gen_pm, pm_count=[8]\n"
#~ "**输出：** 10 个不同磁序结构\n"
#~ "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后 FM/AFM 推理能量误差差距应显著缩小\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\\### Scenario: an FM-trained model fails on AFM states\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "An NEP model for bcc Fe is accurate on FM configurations, but its AFM "
#~ "energy error is five times larger. The training set contains only one "
#~ "magnetic order.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "**Input:** A bcc Fe crystal with an Fe reference moment near 2.2 μB\n"
#~ "**Goal:** Generate 1 FM + 1 AFM + 8 PM-like states so the model sees "
#~ "several local magnetic environments\n"
#~ "**Parameters:** `magmom_map=Fe:2.2`, enable `gen_fm`, `gen_afm`, and "
#~ "`gen_pm`, and set `pm_count=[8]`\n"
#~ "**Output:** Ten magnetic initializations\n"
#~ "**How to verify improvement:** After labeling and retraining, the FM/AFM "
#~ "energy-error gap should decrease substantially\n"
